    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Oldowan is a casual survival sandbox game that is focused on very early humanity and how it developed. The crafting is all based on real practices, but the survival aspects are relaxed. Developing new tools, structures, foods, and materials will allow you to explore, progress, and thrive in an uncomfortable environment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bc7b3f53a93291c6bb4d1250d444ef92.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bc7b3f53a93291c6bb4d1250d444ef92.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Beginning with turning rocks into Oldowan style tools, you'll have to craft if you want to survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Scour the land for resources to craft better tools that unlock more advanced technology.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft furnaces and workbenches to turn your resources into tools, food, shelter and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Build a settlement to defend yourself from neighboring tribes and aggressive wildlife.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Make friend or foe with villages across the land.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With an ever-changing environment, you'll have to adapt to survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>But you don't have to do it all alone. Gather your tribesmen online to fight and survive in this primitive world.",
    "about_the_game": "Oldowan is a casual survival sandbox game that is focused on very early humanity and how it developed. The crafting is all based on real practices, but the survival aspects are relaxed. Developing new tools, structures, foods, and materials will allow you to explore, progress, and thrive in an uncomfortable environment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bc7b3f53a93291c6bb4d1250d444ef92.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bc7b3f53a93291c6bb4d1250d444ef92.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Beginning with turning rocks into Oldowan style tools, you'll have to craft if you want to survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2b604f3f7b829a4a811dc2ca3b5c1f21.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Scour the land for resources to craft better tools that unlock more advanced technology.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/13d23e6ae23e1a6da30e4e4296f58e09.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft furnaces and workbenches to turn your resources into tools, food, shelter and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/6c85c3f8b2caf0a09d1803551b373ed8.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Build a settlement to defend yourself from neighboring tribes and aggressive wildlife.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/bdcb4f982112407c76c211a50e9e8978.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Make friend or foe with villages across the land.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/c75de805ee89126160859aa2a1d54836.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With an ever-changing environment, you'll have to adapt to survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.poster.avif?t=1697071387\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.webm?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662710/extras/2e4e1cbb219582b42aa89cec667b8e11.mp4?t=1697071387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>But you don't have to do it all alone. Gather your tribesmen online to fight and survive in this primitive world.",
